                        "content": "The nurse is evaluating a function of the limbic system as a part of the neurological status of a client. What would the nurse assess?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nAffect and emotions are part of the role of the limbic system and involve both hemispheres of the brain. Pain is a complex experience involving several areas of the central nervous system. The response to verbal stimuli is part of the level of consciousness, which is under the control of the reticular activating system and both cerebral hemispheres. Insight, judgment, and planning are part of the functions of the frontal lobes of the brain in conjunction with association fibers connecting to other areas of the cerebrum.",
                        "id": "0b5431e312be43ecbdcda3ee3d9bf08a",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "361f60c382444fc3aa071e99b8bad0ef",
                                "content": "Clear liquid diet"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "7df8d7490a454bf49c968496d18a44e6",
                                "content": "Bilateral calf measure"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "ac9d2ef1136a444fa5a209d39fcc168b",
                                "content": "Monitor vital signs frequently"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a85df9e8986e404a99573c7f0b5c866c",
                                "content": "Passive range-of-motion (ROM) exercises"
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "361f60c382444fc3aa071e99b8bad0ef",
                                    "content": "Clear liquid diet"
